{"unit_id":"OraSkyC__dsh-bundle-default-workspace#card-zh","repo":"OraSkyC/dsh-bundle-default-workspace","commit":"dc13b375307e1fad2e83ca1fea5cd2880bebdbc9","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"默认工作区是面向 DSH Web 客户端的插件，为临时杂事提供固定的默认工作区。它在插件设置页提供配置卡，并注册 default_workspace 智能体工具，可查询工作区状态、路径和用途，也可按需创建并登记目录、写入 AGENTS.md。插件支持自定义目录位置、标题、说明和种子文案，并提供将内容移入工作区回收站的清空与重置操作。适合不想为一次性任务另建项目、又希望与现有项目目录分开的 DSH 用户。使用 Node.js 22.19.0 以上版本；不需 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1162-1188","lib/index.js:468-505","client.js:1628-1644","cordis.patch.yml:13-55"]}
{"unit_id":"OraSkyC__dsh-bundle-default-workspace#card-en","repo":"OraSkyC/dsh-bundle-default-workspace","commit":"dc13b375307e1fad2e83ca1fea5cd2880bebdbc9","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Default Workspace is a DSH web plugin for temporary tasks. Its settings card configures the workspace; the default_workspace tool checks status or creates it with an AGENTS.md seed. Users can clear or reset it, moving contents to an in-workspace recycle bin. Requires Node.js 22.19.0+; no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1162-1188","lib/index.js:468-505","client.js:1628-1644","cordis.patch.yml:13-55"]}
