{"unit_id":"OraSkyC__dsh-bundle-default-workspace#feature-1","repo":"OraSkyC/dsh-bundle-default-workspace","commit":"dc13b375307e1fad2e83ca1fea5cd2880bebdbc9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"默认工作区 的功能「默认工作区登记」：插件按配置解析父目录和目录名；ensure 操作会创建目录并登记到 DSH 工作区列表，若路径已登记则复用，并可更新显示标题。。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:468-505"]}
